	System V Release 4.0		Ash Nazag

 Mac    startmac        System 7.6.1; leave with Special > Log Out
        Mac OS 8.1:  makemac -e 8.1  once, then  startmac -e 8.1
        startmac6       System 6.0.7; leave with Special > Logout
 TOS    starttos        EmuTOS and TeraDesk; -M TT mono, -m MB ST-RAM
        XaAES:   starttos -e xaaes  (multitasking; maketos -x -e NAME for more)
        Cubase:  starttos -C $HOME/TOS/CUBASE/CUBASE31  (or SCORE, CAF)
 Amiga  startmig        Workbench; -m MB fast RAM (or fastmb=MB in .env)
 CP/M   startcpm        Concurrent CP/M-68K; EXIT ends it, -c N joins
                        A: ~/CPM, H: home, M: temp, O: /, P: DRI's programs
 Win16  startwin        Windows 3.x programs (Program Manager); first
                        startwin -install DISK1.IMG ... (your Windows disks)
 X      startx          twm; or  xsession  for a menu of sessions, or
        xsession twm|xview|mac|tos|amiga|win|console|cpm

 Ctrl-Option-Command-0 shows the console, -1 to -9 the sessions.
 Ctrl-C on the console ends TOS or the Amiga.
 apkg update, apkg install NAME: packages, in /opt/amix/bin
 makemac, maketos, makeamiga make ~/System Folder, ~/TOS, ~/Amiga;
 -f refreshes one from the system's copy, keeping your files.
 exit logs out; root shuts down with  shutdown -y -g0 -i0
